Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.00,0:01:10.40,Accent,,0,0,0,,EVIDENCE BEFORE CONFIDENCE
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Policy answers should not depend on guesswork.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.80,0:00:11.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet EvidenceDesk: a secure, citation-first assistant for organizational documents.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.00,0:00:20.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Upload a handbook, policy, procedure, or scanned PDF. EvidenceDesk extracts text,\Nuses OCR when needed, and stores useful metadata.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.00,0:00:29.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before search begins, it checks tenant, role, and clearance.\NRestricted text is filtered before the answer workflow.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.00,0:00:39.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,A controlled pipeline retrieves passages, expands context, ranks evidence,\Nwrites a grounded answer, and verifies citations.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.50,0:00:49.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The result is an answer you can inspect, with exact source passages.\NIf evidence is missing, EvidenceDesk refuses instead of pretending.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.00,0:00:57.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Conversations, feedback, versions, audit events, and retrieval insights\Nmake it practical—not just a chatbot demo.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.00,0:01:06.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,An honest local portfolio MVP, with evaluation, Docker, CI,\Nand a clear path to standard AWS services.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.00,0:01:10.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,EvidenceDesk. Evidence before confidence.
